# sys-safari-binoculars (docs/research/great-marsh.md): the Pastoria gate 2F's middle binoculars. YES pays 100 and
# start_great_marsh_lookout runs the lookout (GreatMarshLookout_Init): the screen fades out, the Pokétch hides, five
# random marsh spots each open with the iris, a Pokémon of the area in the centre, 60 frames each (an A press ends a view
# early), and close; then the player is back at the binoculars facing north and the screen fades in.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 50 platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW
set state money 3000
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_PASTORIA_CITY_OBSERVATORY_GATE_2F 6 4 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno
+0 assert text platinum:PastoriaCityObservatoryGate2F_Text_AskPut100InBinoculars 0
+0 press a
+1 release a
until idle 3000
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_PASTORIA_CITY_OBSERVATORY_GATE_2F 6 4
+0 assert facing player up
+0 assert state money 2900
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_POKETCH_HIDDEN false
